	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Sixt Car Rental API",
		"description": "Complete CRUD API testing collection for Sixt Car Rental Flask application.\n\n## Nested Resources\n\nThe API supports nested resources for Users, Vehicles, and Rentings endpoints. Add `?nested=true` to GET requests to include related resources:\n\n- **Users**: Returns user with nested rentings (including vehicle, fines, payments) and all associated fines\n- **Vehicles**: Returns vehicle with nested rentings and parkings\n- **Rentings**: Returns renting with nested user, vehicle, fines, and payments\n\nExamples:\n- `GET /api/users/1?nested=true` - Get user with all nested data\n- `GET /api/vehicles?nested=true` - Get all vehicles with nested data\n- `GET /api/rentings/1?nested=true` - Get renting with nested data",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
